(2) If α ⟂ γ and β ⟂ γ, then α ∥ β;  
(3) If m ⊂ α and n ⊂ β, then α ∥ β;  
(4) If m ∉∥ β and β ∉∥ γ, then m ∉∥ γ.  
Among these propositions, the incorrect ones are __________. (Fill in all the correct proposition numbers)

