(II) If α, β∈(0, π/2), and f(α+π/4)= √10/5, f(β+3π/4)= 3√5/5, find sin (α+β)

Given an ellipse C: x²/a² + y²/b² = 1 (with a and b positive but not further specified), its left and right foci F₁ and F₂, and a point P on C, where |PF₁| + |PF₂| equals a certain constant. 

(1) Find the standard equation of ellipse C; 
