(Ⅰ) Find the smallest positive period of f(x);  
(Ⅱ) Find the maximum value of f(x) on the interval [0, ] and the corresponding value of x when the maximum value is attained.

Consider two lines: line l parametrized as
\begin{align*} 
x &= 1 + 4t,\\
y &=  4 + 3t
