Let A be a point on line l and B be a point on line m, and let P be the foot of the perpendicular dropped from A onto line m.

Then \(\overrightarrow{PA}\) is the projection of \(\overrightarrow{BA}\) onto some vector \(\begin{pmatrix} v_1\\v_2 \end{pmatrix}\) that has a special relationship between its components. Find \(\begin{pmatrix}v_1\\v_2 \end{pmatrix}\).

