Four points B, A, E, and L are on a straight line, as shown. The point G is off the line so that ∠BAG = 120° and ∠GEL = 80°. If the reflex angle at G is x°, then what does x equal?

[asy]
draw((0,0)--(30,0),black+linewidth(1));
draw((10,0)--(17,20)--(15,0),black+linewidth(1));
draw((17,16)..(21,20)..(17,24)..(13,20)..(14.668,16.75),black+linewidth(1));
